# Accepted dependency CVEs (read by .github/workflows/reusable-security.yml), one per line as
# `CVE-YYYY-NNNNN`. The dependency scan blocks on HIGH/CRITICAL findings that have a fix.
#
# Every entry needs a comment above it: why it does not apply here or why the fix cannot
# land yet, who decided, and when to look again. An entry without a reason cannot be told
# apart from a CVE silenced to get a build green.
#
# Nothing is accepted.
